{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/1d472d2d4258d81bbd71af396416afdc.apng?t=1764840837\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/1d472d2d4258d81bbd71af396416afdc.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=156 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Rogue</strong> <strong>Sea</strong> is a roguelike strategy game that puts you in the shoes of a pirate captain and their crew. You will manage your vessel as you sail through the treacherous waters of the archipelago, interacting with the scum that inhabits it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/27bc083057a7b1ff491d4dbf064fb7d0.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/27bc083057a7b1ff491d4dbf064fb7d0.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/27bc083057a7b1ff491d4dbf064fb7d0.mp4?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions that impact the outcome of various events and the overall narrative. Sail from island to island on ever-changing map, making each game unique. Defend your reputation and increase your loot by engaging in battles using mechanics that blend deck-building with crew and ship system management. Arm yourself with courage and join the legends of the Red Rogue Sea! \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/f7274bf3f3d1f33ba1e4daeb3532d6f3.webp?t=1764840837\" width=724 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unlock your fleet:</i></strong> Gain access to new ships and factions enabling the use of diverse strategies to outwit the fleet of the fearsome\u00a0Admiral\u00a0White.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/9bf3c42044d1424e7f51002fce2c7acf.apng?t=1764840837\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/9bf3c42044d1424e7f51002fce2c7acf.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=96 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Manage Your Own Vessel:</i></strong> To survive events and battles, you\u2019ll need to command your crew with a firm hand and ensure that all ship systems and resources are used in the most optimal way. Prove that you\u2019re a natural-born strategist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/3ebe224d90b05390a93eed9eab09c930.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=300 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/3ebe224d90b05390a93eed9eab09c930.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/a163a6429834c509019f44091b99002f.webp?t=1764840837\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/a163a6429834c509019f44091b99002f.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=80 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Build Your Tactical Deck:</i></strong> In the heat of battle, you\u2019ll command your crew to execute various actions through a deck of tactic cards that you can build and upgrade, gradually adapting it to your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/03cec0fbb3c5c80103dc9d211a4dce64.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/03cec0fbb3c5c80103dc9d211a4dce64.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/03cec0fbb3c5c80103dc9d211a4dce64.mp4?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Immersive Narrative:</i></strong> Red Rogue Sea features a complex archipelago of islands inhabited by adventurers, wrongdoers, fortune seekers, and of course, ordinary folk. You\u2019ll sail from island to island, interacting with different events and learning more about the place, its people, and the tales of legendary treasures sought by generations of pirates. Your actions will shape the course of your own story, leading you down different\u2014and dangerous\u2014paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/6809cbf3afc1f0a0e36d9620484d68b2.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/6809cbf3afc1f0a0e36d9620484d68b2.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/6809cbf3afc1f0a0e36d9620484d68b2.mp4?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Pirate\u2019s Nest:</strong></i> In each game, you\u2019ll choose a unique captain and and a ship to command. These seas are dangerous, and it\u2019s likely your greed will eventually lead you to a watery grave... but that won\u2019t stop you from trying again with another pirate captain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/2d7a38963e4a68e9da7feaf24e6263c3.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/2d7a38963e4a68e9da7feaf24e6263c3.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/2d7a38963e4a68e9da7feaf24e6263c3.mp4?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/f7274bf3f3d1f33ba1e4daeb3532d6f3.webp?t=1764840837\" width=724 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Our Crew!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sign up for our mailing list and follow us on social media to unlock rewards and get insider information about the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Links can be found in the basic info section (to the right of this text).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/4e8b0fc04b041f5400300128ed7596d8.apng?t=1764840837\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/4e8b0fc04b041f5400300128ed7596d8.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=161 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/9cebccad4b2d73a10b656294771d7c0603caa6da.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Voyage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/38033578ed3ec14814bbb90dcb3e57381ea334e2.jpg"},{"name":"Each Coin Counts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/63042adb084c5b0bcd31404b86025f2ce3c4b268.jpg"},{"name":"Merchant Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/a4cdae63c90c98ba0fa22395fb0e0028e1bd6feb.jpg"},{"name":"Not to be drunk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/adf4dc5292023229c67f0ad7ba15eaf2fed09c4c.jpg"},{"name":"Bargain Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/51c2c844afe131e92b14344a4b8575dbc993d0e7.jpg"},{"name":"The Golden Sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/fef4733ee4805bb2ed82bb1390c484346d880fc9.jpg"},{"name":"The Deep Sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/faf95a3369610cca7e680226716b53caee99e632.jpg"},{"name":"The Sea of the Damned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/80028f1efe35e8d3eb2f88e6be26cdb7d4914a00.jpg"},{"name":"The Red Sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3200220/67b9c01dea916170767f2c25765079d021b6b044.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3200220?t=1764840837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764840837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/2fbe1c1c3faf112186e734fe81d62e12ecacda65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764840837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/2fbe1c1c3faf112186e734fe81d62e12ecacda65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764840837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"In-game combat mechanics include shooting cannons, firearms and melee combat with weapons. Therefore, some blood and corpses will appear, but in a cartoonish / pixel art style. Inside the narrative, some specific events will make reference to alcohol (grog), smoking and gambling, in a typical pirate way, but are not part of any core in-game mechanics."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/1d472d2d4258d81bbd71af396416afdc.apng?t=1764840837\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/1d472d2d4258d81bbd71af396416afdc.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=156 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Rogue</strong> <strong>Sea</strong> is a roguelike strategy game that puts you in the shoes of a pirate captain and their crew. You will manage your vessel as you sail through the treacherous waters of the archipelago, interacting with the scum that inhabits it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/27bc083057a7b1ff491d4dbf064fb7d0.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/27bc083057a7b1ff491d4dbf064fb7d0.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/27bc083057a7b1ff491d4dbf064fb7d0.mp4?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make decisions that impact the outcome of various events and the overall narrative. Sail from island to island on ever-changing map, making each game unique. Defend your reputation and increase your loot by engaging in battles using mechanics that blend deck-building with crew and ship system management. Arm yourself with courage and join the legends of the Red Rogue Sea! \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/f7274bf3f3d1f33ba1e4daeb3532d6f3.webp?t=1764840837\" width=724 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Unlock your fleet:</i></strong> Gain access to new ships and factions enabling the use of diverse strategies to outwit the fleet of the fearsome\u00a0Admiral\u00a0White.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/9bf3c42044d1424e7f51002fce2c7acf.apng?t=1764840837\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/9bf3c42044d1424e7f51002fce2c7acf.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=96 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Manage Your Own Vessel:</i></strong> To survive events and battles, you\u2019ll need to command your crew with a firm hand and ensure that all ship systems and resources are used in the most optimal way. Prove that you\u2019re a natural-born strategist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/3ebe224d90b05390a93eed9eab09c930.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=300 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/3ebe224d90b05390a93eed9eab09c930.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/a163a6429834c509019f44091b99002f.webp?t=1764840837\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/a163a6429834c509019f44091b99002f.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" class=\"bb_img\" width=300 height=80 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Build Your Tactical Deck:</i></strong> In the heat of battle, you\u2019ll command your crew to execute various actions through a deck of tactic cards that you can build and upgrade, gradually adapting it to your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/03cec0fbb3c5c80103dc9d211a4dce64.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/03cec0fbb3c5c80103dc9d211a4dce64.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/03cec0fbb3c5c80103dc9d211a4dce64.mp4?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Immersive Narrative:</i></strong> Red Rogue Sea features a complex archipelago of islands inhabited by adventurers, wrongdoers, fortune seekers, and of course, ordinary folk. You\u2019ll sail from island to island, interacting with different events and learning more about the place, its people, and the tales of legendary treasures sought by generations of pirates. Your actions will shape the course of your own story, leading you down different\u2014and dangerous\u2014paths.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/6809cbf3afc1f0a0e36d9620484d68b2.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/6809cbf3afc1f0a0e36d9620484d68b2.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/6809cbf3afc1f0a0e36d9620484d68b2.mp4?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Pirate\u2019s Nest:</strong></i> In each game, you\u2019ll choose a unique captain and and a ship to command. These seas are dangerous, and it\u2019s likely your greed will eventually lead you to a watery grave... but that won\u2019t stop you from trying again with another pirate captain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/2d7a38963e4a68e9da7feaf24e6263c3.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/2d7a38963e4a68e9da7feaf24e6263c3.webm?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/2d7a38963e4a68e9da7feaf24e6263c3.mp4?t=1764840837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/f7274bf3f3d1f33ba1e4daeb3532d6f3.webp?t=1764840837\" width=724 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Our Crew!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sign up for our mailing list and follow us on social media to unlock rewards and get insider information about the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Links can be found in the basic info section (to the right of this text).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/4e8b0fc04b041f5400300128ed7596d8.apng?t=1764840837\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/extras/4e8b0fc04b041f5400300128ed7596d8.poster.avif?t=1764840837\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=161 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Firemage Studios"],"dlc":[4177940],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3200220/header.jpg?t=1764840837","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All content in this game is property of Firemage Studios. Unauthorized use is 